WEBVTT

00:00:54.783 --> 00:00:56.827
ALL CHARACTERS, PLACES, AND EVENTS
IN THIS WORK ARE FICTITIOUS

00:00:56.910 --> 00:00:58.537
CHILD ACTORS WERE FILMED
WITH GUARDIANS PRESENT

00:01:48.503 --> 00:01:49.588
Boss.

00:01:52.549 --> 00:01:53.550
That really hurts.

00:01:54.051 --> 00:01:56.178
So that's what love does to people.

00:01:56.803 --> 00:02:00.265
You really got that fired up
over a few insults?

00:02:01.725 --> 00:02:04.311
Just out of curiosity

00:02:04.895 --> 00:02:08.232
did you really think
you could take those guys?

00:02:08.315 --> 00:02:11.777
I just wanted to get my ass kicked.
Hard enough to knock my senses out.

00:02:12.986 --> 00:02:14.696
You're a pervert, aren't you?

00:02:16.907 --> 00:02:18.325
You're totally my type.

00:02:37.052 --> 00:02:41.014
NEWSHOUND HEE-KOOK

00:02:42.557 --> 00:02:44.559
What's going on
between Ah-jin and In-gang?

00:02:44.643 --> 00:02:45.644
Did you call for a driver?

00:02:47.646 --> 00:02:50.482
They were making out.
Did he dump you for her?

00:02:52.609 --> 00:02:54.278
Lena, are you there?

00:02:55.070 --> 00:02:56.280
Are you in shock?

00:03:32.733 --> 00:03:33.734
Be careful.

00:03:34.234 --> 00:03:38.238
Lena's cousin, reporter Lim Hee-kook,
knows about you and In-gang.

00:03:54.254 --> 00:03:59.176
EPISODE 7: THE WHEEL OF FATE

00:04:00.552 --> 00:04:03.555
Do you know how damaging
a scandal like this can be for you?

00:04:04.556 --> 00:04:08.935
I'll try to keep the press at bay,
but you need to end things with him.

00:04:09.936 --> 00:04:11.355
It's better to end it now

00:04:11.438 --> 00:04:13.774
than let a messy relationship
make things awkward at work.

00:04:14.900 --> 00:04:15.901
Ms. Seo.

00:04:17.069 --> 00:04:19.738
This isn't some casual fling.

00:04:20.322 --> 00:04:22.115
We really like each other.

00:04:22.199 --> 00:04:23.200
Are you joking?

00:04:24.326 --> 00:04:26.995
You're a smart girl,
so stop acting like you don't get it.

00:04:27.329 --> 00:04:29.623
This isn't the right time
for you to be dating.

00:04:30.832 --> 00:04:33.752
Did you get this photo
from Lim Hee-kook?

00:04:33.835 --> 00:04:34.836
Why do you ask?

00:04:34.920 --> 00:04:36.213
I'll talk to him.

00:04:36.296 --> 00:04:38.173
He doesn't like you. You know that.

00:04:38.256 --> 00:04:40.634
If he reached out to you
before running the story

00:04:41.176 --> 00:04:42.761
he must be after something.

00:04:43.428 --> 00:04:45.972
I'd like to talk to him in person.

00:04:46.056 --> 00:04:47.599
What are you going to do?

00:04:47.682 --> 00:04:49.017
I'll hear him out

00:04:49.893 --> 00:04:51.978
and if the terms are acceptable,
I'll cut a deal.

00:05:03.532 --> 00:05:06.701
I'll see myself out
so the two of you can talk.

00:05:24.052 --> 00:05:25.429
What happened?

00:05:26.888 --> 00:05:30.475
You said yourself
you wanted nothing to do with her.

00:05:31.268 --> 00:05:33.061
I'm sorry I didn't tell you sooner.

00:05:35.188 --> 00:05:36.648
I didn't expect this to happen.

00:05:36.940 --> 00:05:38.483
Forget about her for a second.

00:05:38.567 --> 00:05:41.236
Do you know how bad this scandal
will make you look?

00:05:41.319 --> 00:05:43.613
You just announced
your breakup with Lena.

00:05:43.697 --> 00:05:46.825
People will call it a rebound,
and you'll get slammed for it.

00:05:46.908 --> 00:05:48.952
Things like this
don't sit well with the public.

00:05:49.035 --> 00:05:50.829
How are you going to handle that?

00:05:51.413 --> 00:05:52.414
Mi-ri.

00:05:53.707 --> 00:05:55.250
I'm no longer afraid of that.

00:05:56.460 --> 00:05:58.295
I'm not taking this lightly either.

00:05:59.880 --> 00:06:01.173
I'll take whatever comes.

00:06:02.007 --> 00:06:03.717
- You really--
- I'd really love it

00:06:04.259 --> 00:06:06.386
if you could give us your blessing.

00:06:08.180 --> 00:06:10.182
Give us your support.

00:06:13.143 --> 00:06:14.394
You'll do that, right?

00:06:32.120 --> 00:06:34.289
I heard you're good at your job

00:06:34.706 --> 00:06:36.416
so I wanted to treat you to a meal.

00:06:37.959 --> 00:06:41.379
You know how touchy folks are
about scandals these days.

00:06:41.755 --> 00:06:45.008
He started dating you
the moment he broke up with Lena.

00:06:45.383 --> 00:06:49.804
That's the kind of thing
that can ruin a beloved actor.

00:06:51.806 --> 00:06:53.892
You're not very good
at making threats.

00:06:53.975 --> 00:06:56.436
Save that speech for In-gang.

00:06:56.520 --> 00:06:59.272
I don't have much to lose
from this relationship.

00:06:59.981 --> 00:07:02.108
If anything,
it might even spark some curiosity.

00:07:02.192 --> 00:07:03.235
Fine.

00:07:03.902 --> 00:07:04.986
In that case

00:07:05.654 --> 00:07:08.448
I'll release this article as well.

00:07:12.160 --> 00:07:13.620
BAEK AH-JIN BECOMES
HEO IN-GANG'S GIRL

00:07:13.703 --> 00:07:17.457
Don't you think
that headline is a little tacky?

00:07:17.832 --> 00:07:19.709
- Excuse me?
- Change the headline

00:07:19.793 --> 00:07:22.128
to "Baek Ah-jin, the woman
who captured In-gang's heart."

00:07:25.507 --> 00:07:26.591
Listen, Ms. Baek.

00:07:28.009 --> 00:07:31.304
Mr. Lim, I hear you're Lena's cousin.

00:07:31.805 --> 00:07:34.266
Cousins hang out when they're kids.

00:07:34.349 --> 00:07:36.351
And as adults,
exchange occasional texts.

00:07:36.434 --> 00:07:40.063
So why don't you leave it at that
and get friendly with me instead?

00:07:40.647 --> 00:07:42.023
I don't need friends.

00:07:42.941 --> 00:07:45.860
But I'm all ears
if you're offering something else.

00:07:45.944 --> 00:07:46.945
Do you mean money?

00:07:50.365 --> 00:07:54.995
You're already getting a salary,
so I don't need to pad your pockets.

00:07:55.954 --> 00:07:57.747
You know how it is.

00:07:57.831 --> 00:08:01.376
People are always curious
about celebrity relationships.

00:08:01.793 --> 00:08:04.879
Someone else's love life
is always more entertaining.

00:08:04.963 --> 00:08:08.383
I was hoping you'd be the one
to write those entertaining pieces.

00:08:08.466 --> 00:08:10.594
So? What's the catch?

00:08:10.677 --> 00:08:13.471
If you accept my offer right now

00:08:13.555 --> 00:08:18.518
I'll give you the exclusive rights
to our love story.

00:08:19.019 --> 00:08:21.813
Of course, this stays between us.

00:08:23.315 --> 00:08:26.526
You can use the photos
in this flash drive.

00:08:29.487 --> 00:08:32.574
Who took these photos?

00:08:32.657 --> 00:08:35.368
I'm giving them to you
so you don't have to tail me.

00:08:35.744 --> 00:08:37.621
And I'll keep them coming.

00:08:38.955 --> 00:08:40.248
You won't regret this.

00:08:41.374 --> 00:08:42.876
I guarantee you

00:08:42.959 --> 00:08:46.671
that my love story will be fiery
and impossible to ignore.

00:08:47.547 --> 00:08:51.176
Rising star Baek Ah-jin
and actor Heo In-gang

00:08:51.259 --> 00:08:54.638
were spotted
on a private outing in Gangnam.

00:08:54.721 --> 00:08:58.600
As news of their blossoming romance
sweeps across the country

00:08:58.683 --> 00:09:00.977
fans appear split.

00:09:01.061 --> 00:09:04.856
Some are thrilled,
saying the two look perfect together.

00:09:04.939 --> 00:09:07.192
Others, however,
are criticizing the timing

00:09:07.275 --> 00:09:10.445
accusing him of moving on too quickly
after his breakup with Lena.

00:09:10.528 --> 00:09:14.366
Whatever the truth may be,
it's a new beginning for the couple.

00:09:14.449 --> 00:09:18.244
So rather than dragging them down,
we should show them a little support.

00:09:23.792 --> 00:09:24.918
- Hyang-i.
- Yes?

00:09:25.835 --> 00:09:27.921
- Are you going on a date today?
- No.

00:09:29.673 --> 00:09:31.800
Come on.
It's written all over your face.

00:09:32.717 --> 00:09:33.968
Is it a blind date?

00:09:34.052 --> 00:09:35.512
Something like that.

00:09:35.845 --> 00:09:36.846
What time?

00:09:36.930 --> 00:09:37.931
It's at 7 p.m.

00:09:38.556 --> 00:09:39.557
Why do you ask?

00:09:40.141 --> 00:09:41.601
I'll let the salon know.

00:09:41.685 --> 00:09:43.853
Get your hair done nicely
and have fun.

00:09:44.646 --> 00:09:46.731
Thank you so much, Ah-jin!

00:09:47.607 --> 00:09:50.110
- And don't drink too much.
- I won't.

00:09:50.193 --> 00:09:52.153
You get way too honest
when you drink.

00:09:52.445 --> 00:09:53.780
Okay, I promise.

00:09:54.698 --> 00:09:55.699
I'll watch my mouth.

00:09:57.367 --> 00:09:59.411
Why are you so handsome?

00:10:00.912 --> 00:10:02.455
You're a manager

00:10:02.539 --> 00:10:05.208
so you must meet
a lot of good-looking celebrities.

00:10:05.291 --> 00:10:08.420
Being a manager
isn't all it's cracked up to be.

00:10:08.503 --> 00:10:11.840
You have no idea
how much dirt we have to deal with.

00:10:13.550 --> 00:10:15.844
Did you take the blame
for someone else's crime?

00:10:16.302 --> 00:10:17.512
How did you know that?

00:10:20.640 --> 00:10:23.017
No. You didn't hear it from me.

00:10:24.436 --> 00:10:25.603
Don't do that to me.

00:10:25.687 --> 00:10:27.439
I'll keep it to myself, so tell me.

00:10:27.522 --> 00:10:28.523
No.

00:10:34.654 --> 00:10:35.697
Hyang-i.

00:10:39.659 --> 00:10:42.328
Talking to someone can help you
get things off your chest.

00:10:43.246 --> 00:10:45.123
I promise I'll keep it a secret.

00:10:51.755 --> 00:10:54.215
You can't tell anyone about this.

00:10:57.927 --> 00:11:00.680
A few years back...

00:11:30.835 --> 00:11:32.170
- Hyang-i.
- Yes?

00:11:33.296 --> 00:11:34.506
Thanks for telling me.

00:11:35.673 --> 00:11:37.717
Don't tell anyone else.

00:11:42.013 --> 00:11:43.389
I'm supposed to take a break?

00:11:43.473 --> 00:11:46.100
- There must be scripts coming in.
- There are.

00:11:46.184 --> 00:11:50.980
But the other actors turn it down
when they find out you're the lead.

00:11:51.397 --> 00:11:52.440
You have to accept it.

00:11:52.524 --> 00:11:55.193
Who would want to work with
an actress who beat up a junior?

00:11:55.276 --> 00:11:56.444
Seriously.

00:11:56.861 --> 00:11:58.279
I slapped her once.

00:11:59.322 --> 00:12:00.323
Twice, tops.

00:12:00.949 --> 00:12:02.075
And I had my reasons.

00:12:02.408 --> 00:12:04.577
Do you know how she got back at me?

00:12:04.661 --> 00:12:06.454
You know how ruthless she is.

00:12:06.788 --> 00:12:07.997
What am I going to do with you?

00:12:08.706 --> 00:12:09.707
What's with that look?

00:12:10.041 --> 00:12:12.001
You still haven't come
to your senses.

00:12:13.670 --> 00:12:14.671
Get out of here.

00:12:34.983 --> 00:12:37.151
When Lena got caught driving drunk

00:12:38.236 --> 00:12:40.947
I covered for her
and said I was the one driving.

00:12:42.198 --> 00:12:43.533
I was even interrogated

00:12:43.616 --> 00:12:46.160
for supposedly
driving under the influence.

00:12:46.578 --> 00:12:47.579
Lena.

00:12:57.630 --> 00:12:59.090
Why do you look so surprised?

00:13:09.851 --> 00:13:11.436
Well, I warned you

00:13:12.770 --> 00:13:13.897
not to mess with me.

00:13:16.357 --> 00:13:17.734
Why won't you ever listen?

00:13:21.112 --> 00:13:23.823
It kind of kills the fun
if you're already making that face.

00:13:23.907 --> 00:13:27.118
Tell me you didn't
release this video yet.

00:13:28.995 --> 00:13:30.246
You didn't, right?

00:13:30.747 --> 00:13:31.748
Oh, dear.

00:13:34.375 --> 00:13:35.710
Is that what you want to know?

00:13:35.793 --> 00:13:39.547
Please, Ah-jin.
If this goes public, I'm finished.

00:13:39.631 --> 00:13:41.299
You can take everything from me.

00:13:41.591 --> 00:13:42.717
Just help me.

00:13:44.302 --> 00:13:45.595
Who says you're finished?

00:13:49.682 --> 00:13:51.935
You're not.
This is just the beginning.

00:13:52.435 --> 00:13:54.395
Hell doesn't end with a single blow.

00:14:11.955 --> 00:14:12.956
See?

00:14:13.456 --> 00:14:14.999
This won't be ending anytime soon.

00:14:20.630 --> 00:14:24.217
That's why you should've
listened to me.

00:14:25.885 --> 00:14:29.430
I wouldn't have taken it this far
if you had left me alone.

00:14:32.308 --> 00:14:34.602
Don't ever think about
coming back to this business.

00:14:34.686 --> 00:14:36.187
And spare yourself the fantasy

00:14:36.270 --> 00:14:38.564
that you can disappear
for a few years and sneak back in.

00:14:38.815 --> 00:14:40.441
Don't beg me to save you either.

00:14:41.526 --> 00:14:42.819
Because I won't.

00:14:44.112 --> 00:14:46.030
Own it, Lena.

00:14:46.864 --> 00:14:49.117
Or let yourself crumble.

00:14:55.039 --> 00:14:56.040
No.

00:14:59.002 --> 00:15:00.003
What do I do?

00:15:25.486 --> 00:15:26.821
Did you see the video?

00:15:30.241 --> 00:15:32.744
This is all because you couldn't keep
your mouth shut.

00:15:34.787 --> 00:15:36.497
I told you to watch what you say.

00:15:39.208 --> 00:15:41.127
This isn't going to work between us.

00:15:41.878 --> 00:15:45.548
How am I supposed to trust you
after what you spilled?

00:15:46.591 --> 00:15:47.592
Wouldn't you agree?

00:15:50.470 --> 00:15:52.013
Consider today your last day.

00:15:54.766 --> 00:15:55.767
Ah-jin.

00:15:58.728 --> 00:16:01.731
- Happy birthday to you
- Happy birthday to you

00:16:01.814 --> 00:16:04.609
- Happy birthday to you
- Happy birthday to you

00:16:05.693 --> 00:16:06.778
HAPPY BIRTHDAY
HONG KYUNG-SUK

00:16:08.321 --> 00:16:10.990
This is my favorite color.

00:16:11.074 --> 00:16:12.575
I'm glad you like it.

00:16:12.658 --> 00:16:13.910
Thank you, Ah-jin.

00:16:14.577 --> 00:16:17.246
All right. One, two, three.

00:16:17.538 --> 00:16:21.417
This has been such a lovely birthday.

00:16:32.595 --> 00:16:33.596
WINTER SLEEP

00:17:00.915 --> 00:17:03.042
How was your trip?

00:17:07.046 --> 00:17:09.215
HEO IN-GANG AND BAEK AH-JIN'S OUTFITS
AT THE AIRPORT

00:17:23.187 --> 00:17:26.149
HEO IN-GANG AND BAEK AH-JIN
ON SUMMER VACATION

00:17:51.924 --> 00:17:55.469
I'm deeply in love with her.

00:17:55.928 --> 00:17:57.763
So, I hope you guys understand.

00:17:57.847 --> 00:17:59.849
Show my Ah-jin some love.

00:17:59.932 --> 00:18:01.767
LIVE

00:18:25.458 --> 00:18:27.627
HEO IN-GANG AND BAEK AH-JIN
CAUGHT ON THE CUTEST DATE

00:18:27.710 --> 00:18:29.629
#LOVESTAGRAM #COUPLE
#BAEKGANG #COUPLEVIBES

00:18:39.222 --> 00:18:40.514
Were you writing again?

00:18:41.098 --> 00:18:42.516
I knew it.

00:18:42.975 --> 00:18:46.938
You obviously skipped breakfast.
Don't tell me you also skipped lunch.

00:18:47.563 --> 00:18:49.148
I brought you lunch just in case.

00:18:49.232 --> 00:18:51.734
I'm finishing up. You can eat first.

00:18:51.817 --> 00:18:53.611
Why don't you just join me?

00:18:54.362 --> 00:18:55.947
I bought this for you.

00:19:02.578 --> 00:19:03.579
Ta-da.

00:19:04.288 --> 00:19:05.289
Here.

00:19:07.333 --> 00:19:08.584
Are you busy tonight?

00:19:09.001 --> 00:19:10.086
No. Why?

00:19:10.795 --> 00:19:13.589
Let's go to the premiere
of the movie Ah-jin is in.

00:19:16.133 --> 00:19:18.928
I just want to see if she's any good.

00:19:19.011 --> 00:19:20.888
I'll laugh at her if she's bad.

00:19:22.473 --> 00:19:23.474
Eat up.

00:19:31.148 --> 00:19:32.775
Hi, I'm Baek Ah-jin.

00:19:32.858 --> 00:19:34.360
VIP SCREENING
THE WOMAN WITH A SUITCASE

00:19:34.443 --> 00:19:37.154
I played Myo-hui.

00:19:37.238 --> 00:19:40.074
We had a lot of fun
filming this movie.

00:19:40.157 --> 00:19:45.204
Watching Myo-hui spiral into madness
should give you chills.

00:19:45.288 --> 00:19:47.540
Thank you for coming.
I hope you enjoy the movie.

00:19:47.623 --> 00:19:48.624
Thank you.

00:19:59.260 --> 00:20:01.929
THE WOMAN WITH A SUITCASE

00:20:15.568 --> 00:20:18.404
Jun-seo, you'll help me, right?

00:20:23.743 --> 00:20:25.244
Don't worry, Jun-seo.

00:20:27.330 --> 00:20:29.123
I'll date him for exactly a year.

00:20:33.044 --> 00:20:34.420
That's all I need.

00:20:44.430 --> 00:20:48.225
Reporters who saw the screening
are already writing their pieces

00:20:48.309 --> 00:20:49.727
and they're pretty favorable.

00:20:52.355 --> 00:20:53.773
I'm proud of you, Ah-jin.

00:21:05.201 --> 00:21:06.535
You smell nice.

00:21:07.119 --> 00:21:08.662
What cologne did you use today?

00:21:09.747 --> 00:21:12.083
I forgot to put any on.

00:21:15.586 --> 00:21:17.004
Then keep it that way.

00:21:18.255 --> 00:21:21.592
I like your natural scent
better than any cologne.

00:21:26.472 --> 00:21:27.932
I like you better than anything.

00:21:40.611 --> 00:21:44.281
Out gallivanting
instead of writing until this hour?

00:21:45.116 --> 00:21:48.828
Keep acting like a wife,
and I'll change the door code.

00:21:50.413 --> 00:21:53.040
Honey, what does "co-offender" mean?

00:21:53.124 --> 00:21:54.291
You don't need to know.

00:21:55.793 --> 00:21:57.044
I'll just look it up.

00:22:00.923 --> 00:22:04.009
"A person who, together with others,
directly carries out an act

00:22:04.093 --> 00:22:06.220
that satisfies the elements
of a criminal offense

00:22:06.303 --> 00:22:08.514
of the act itself"?

00:22:11.434 --> 00:22:13.394
Why the sudden interest in my book?

00:22:16.480 --> 00:22:18.649
I'm suddenly interested in you.

00:22:24.864 --> 00:22:27.741
Did Ah-jin call you?

00:22:28.159 --> 00:22:30.202
She doesn't call me nowadays.

00:22:33.622 --> 00:22:34.790
I guess she's happy.

00:22:40.546 --> 00:22:41.547
No.

00:22:42.006 --> 00:22:43.674
When the boss needs me

00:22:43.757 --> 00:22:46.635
it means something bad
has happened to her.

00:22:48.053 --> 00:22:49.430
So no news means good news.

00:22:50.347 --> 00:22:51.515
But...

00:22:59.773 --> 00:23:03.152
If I'm being honest,
I wish she would call me.

00:23:05.488 --> 00:23:06.572
I don't know.

00:23:10.159 --> 00:23:11.202
Want to grab a drink?

00:23:12.036 --> 00:23:13.037
No.

00:23:14.330 --> 00:23:15.498
Go home.

00:23:20.711 --> 00:23:22.922
I don't have a home.

00:23:23.380 --> 00:23:25.382
And if I leave, you'll die.

00:23:27.134 --> 00:23:28.344
Of boredom.

00:23:45.236 --> 00:23:47.154
MOM

00:23:48.030 --> 00:23:50.658
Pick up your phone. It's so loud.

00:23:51.283 --> 00:23:53.035
I'm trying to read here.

00:23:59.833 --> 00:24:01.335
Why won't you pick up?

00:24:04.296 --> 00:24:06.882
MOM

00:24:08.801 --> 00:24:09.802
Dude.

00:24:10.302 --> 00:24:12.012
You can't do that to your mother.

00:24:12.596 --> 00:24:15.266
How bad is it between you two
that you keep dodging her calls?

00:24:17.017 --> 00:24:18.477
You're a horrible son.

00:24:27.403 --> 00:24:29.446
Why aren't you answering my calls?

00:24:30.072 --> 00:24:32.032
The money you send me
is downright insulting.

00:24:37.997 --> 00:24:38.998
Jun-seo.

00:24:40.749 --> 00:24:42.042
I'll give you a week.

00:24:43.460 --> 00:24:45.379
Wire the money within a week.

00:24:57.182 --> 00:25:01.437
Don't let my mom know
about Grandpa's condition.

00:25:03.105 --> 00:25:05.774
If she comes by, just send her away.

00:25:06.442 --> 00:25:08.444
Do you get what I'm saying?

00:25:09.445 --> 00:25:11.322
Yes, I do.

00:25:11.739 --> 00:25:13.157
Don't worry, Mr. Yoon.

00:25:31.592 --> 00:25:32.676
All done, ma'am.

00:25:34.386 --> 00:25:35.512
Thank you.

00:26:05.334 --> 00:26:07.252
INVESTMENT AGREEMENT

00:26:07.336 --> 00:26:08.796
LONGSTAR ENTERTAINMENT

00:26:21.600 --> 00:26:22.643
Did you put him up to it?

00:26:23.060 --> 00:26:25.187
You made him invest
in your company, didn't you?

00:26:26.063 --> 00:26:27.773
You haven't changed one bit.

00:26:28.691 --> 00:26:29.692
Doesn't it get tiring?

00:26:29.775 --> 00:26:31.860
You talked him into it.

00:26:31.944 --> 00:26:33.737
You only play the mother
because you're after

00:26:33.821 --> 00:26:35.155
your illegitimate
child's inheritance.

00:26:35.239 --> 00:26:36.782
So you have no right
to say that to me.

00:26:39.326 --> 00:26:41.245
That doesn't work on me anymore.

00:26:41.328 --> 00:26:43.497
So, you want Jun-seo to die.

00:26:44.498 --> 00:26:45.499
Don't you know

00:26:45.999 --> 00:26:49.420
how much he loves
his dad and grandpa?

00:26:50.337 --> 00:26:52.631
If he finds out
he isn't the biological son

00:26:52.715 --> 00:26:53.882
what do you think will happen?

00:26:55.509 --> 00:26:57.302
If you're set on destroying him

00:26:57.386 --> 00:26:59.054
be my guest.

00:27:02.182 --> 00:27:03.183
I'm sick of this.

00:27:11.692 --> 00:27:12.693
Hi.

00:27:16.405 --> 00:27:17.740
Thank you.

00:27:18.782 --> 00:27:20.826
- Can we get a photo?
- Just one photo.

00:27:20.909 --> 00:27:21.910
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

00:27:23.537 --> 00:27:24.621
One, two, three.

00:27:27.332 --> 00:27:28.459
Don't cry.

00:27:29.918 --> 00:27:31.253
It's not over yet.

00:27:34.256 --> 00:27:36.133
You all need to know
what she really is!

00:27:36.216 --> 00:27:39.261
It was all her, you fucking idiots!

00:27:51.148 --> 00:27:54.777
You really thought
you could beat me, didn't you?

00:27:55.611 --> 00:27:59.448
Thank you for making my school life
so much less boring.

00:28:05.412 --> 00:28:07.998
I'm exposing
who Baek Ah-jin really is.

00:28:09.458 --> 00:28:12.544
We were classmates in 11th grade.

00:28:12.628 --> 00:28:14.630
She was the devil.

00:28:16.507 --> 00:28:19.760
She extorted money
from the other students at school.

00:28:20.219 --> 00:28:23.430
And she framed me for theft,
so I even had to transfer schools.

00:28:25.474 --> 00:28:29.895
What kind of messed-up world
lets someone like her be a celebrity?

00:28:30.521 --> 00:28:32.105
It's absurd.

00:28:33.774 --> 00:28:35.192
None of this is a lie.

00:28:35.692 --> 00:28:38.570
I'll answer any questions
you have for me.

00:28:38.987 --> 00:28:41.114
EXTORTION, BLACKMAIL
FALSE ACCUSATION

00:28:41.198 --> 00:28:42.407
RAN A STUDENT LOAN SCHEME...

00:28:42.491 --> 00:28:43.617
STIRRED UP TROUBLE...

00:28:45.536 --> 00:28:47.538
Is this for real, guys?

00:28:47.621 --> 00:28:51.375
Baek Ah-jin's shocking past
has been brought to light.

00:28:51.458 --> 00:28:54.336
A single post
on a forum is blowing up.

00:28:54.419 --> 00:28:56.797
"I'm exposing
who Baek Ah-jin really is.

00:28:56.880 --> 00:28:59.800
We were classmates in 11th grade.

00:28:59.883 --> 00:29:01.176
She was the devil."

00:29:01.260 --> 00:29:03.887
You can tell from the first line
that this is big.

00:29:04.555 --> 00:29:05.556
But this is where...

00:29:05.639 --> 00:29:08.100
I think I know who this is.
Are you Sim Sung-hee?

00:29:08.183 --> 00:29:09.476
Wait, I think I remember her.

00:29:09.560 --> 00:29:13.021
She stole stuff and spread rumors,
so she was transferred.

00:29:13.105 --> 00:29:15.941
Everyone who grew up in Nojeong-gu
knows who she is.

00:29:16.024 --> 00:29:18.277
If you have a conscience,
delete this post.

00:29:18.360 --> 00:29:19.820
Wow, she's still at it.

00:29:19.903 --> 00:29:23.240
Sung-hee,
you're still the same crazy bitch.

00:29:24.658 --> 00:29:26.159
It's not true.

00:29:26.535 --> 00:29:28.704
You saw how it was deleted instantly.

00:29:28.787 --> 00:29:31.331
I was a model student back in school.

00:29:33.375 --> 00:29:36.879
Fine. I'll take your word for it.

00:29:38.171 --> 00:29:40.966
Fortunately, it doesn't look like
the media will blow it up.

00:29:41.842 --> 00:29:44.887
We'll chalk it up to
some hater acting out.

00:29:46.513 --> 00:29:49.516
On the bright side,
I'm receiving positive comments too.

00:29:49.600 --> 00:29:51.059
I get a little shy reading them.

00:29:53.645 --> 00:29:54.855
You think this is funny?

00:29:56.565 --> 00:29:59.818
You're really stressing me out here.

00:29:59.902 --> 00:30:03.155
Things like this
could come back to bite you.

00:30:03.238 --> 00:30:05.908
And that would be a real headache.

00:30:05.991 --> 00:30:07.701
Especially the reporters.

00:30:08.785 --> 00:30:10.787
Be careful around them, okay?

00:30:11.705 --> 00:30:13.790
I will. Don't worry.

00:30:14.082 --> 00:30:16.960
I'm trusting you on this.

00:30:20.756 --> 00:30:22.925
Will you be okay sleeping without me?

00:30:23.008 --> 00:30:24.760
Should I ask my grandma to come over?

00:30:25.344 --> 00:30:26.637
No, it's fine.

00:30:27.262 --> 00:30:29.556
I'll get some sleep
and call you later.

00:30:31.892 --> 00:30:34.227
Okay. Sleep tight.

00:31:23.568 --> 00:31:24.653
Ah-jin.

00:31:30.742 --> 00:31:31.827
Ah-jin.

00:31:34.413 --> 00:31:35.622
Ah-jin?

00:31:41.128 --> 00:31:42.546
- Ah-jin.
- Ah-jin!

00:31:53.473 --> 00:31:54.891
Ah-jin!

00:31:58.186 --> 00:31:59.271
Ah-jin.

00:32:01.064 --> 00:32:02.149
Ah-jin?

00:32:43.482 --> 00:32:45.233
How sick are you?

00:32:46.276 --> 00:32:48.820
What brings you here?

00:32:51.740 --> 00:32:55.994
You should have told me
if you were sick.

00:32:58.371 --> 00:32:59.581
Grandma.

00:33:00.540 --> 00:33:04.920
You should've rung the doorbell.
How long were you out there?

00:33:05.003 --> 00:33:06.713
Think about yourself right now.

00:33:07.839 --> 00:33:11.218
Do I have to hear from In-gang
that you're sick?

00:33:13.095 --> 00:33:14.638
It must've been cold out there.

00:33:16.098 --> 00:33:19.017
You get used to the cold
when you're old.

00:33:23.730 --> 00:33:25.982
You must've been scared, dear.

00:33:28.235 --> 00:33:31.279
Being alone
when you're sick is scary.

00:33:31.363 --> 00:33:32.364
Come on.

00:33:39.579 --> 00:33:41.123
Go on. Eat up.

00:34:04.104 --> 00:34:09.442
Once you get better,
let's go get some fresh air.

00:34:50.233 --> 00:34:52.319
I fed a stray once.

00:34:53.945 --> 00:34:58.325
And the next day,
she came back with her kitten.

00:35:00.785 --> 00:35:03.038
She must've wanted me to help.

00:35:04.372 --> 00:35:06.833
She must've wanted me
to help her kitten.

00:35:07.375 --> 00:35:10.420
Even that tiny creature was a mother.

00:35:12.589 --> 00:35:14.507
That's just how mothers are.

00:35:17.510 --> 00:35:20.222
She's such a pretty little thing.

00:35:21.431 --> 00:35:25.310
I'll show her to you someday.

00:35:27.229 --> 00:35:28.230
Okay.

00:35:33.485 --> 00:35:34.486
Ah-jin.

00:35:35.946 --> 00:35:38.949
No matter what happens,
I'm on your side.

00:35:41.076 --> 00:35:44.663
Even if everything
they wrote about you was true

00:35:46.081 --> 00:35:50.377
I know you must've had your reasons.

00:35:53.213 --> 00:35:59.469
I know how gentle and kind you are.

00:36:03.890 --> 00:36:05.267
Everyone...

00:36:08.436 --> 00:36:10.855
says I'm a bad person.

00:36:16.528 --> 00:36:18.738
What am I...

00:36:21.116 --> 00:36:22.284
to you?

00:36:30.417 --> 00:36:31.793
A gift...

00:36:34.087 --> 00:36:37.632
A gift from my daughter.

00:36:38.550 --> 00:36:40.552
Just like In-gang and In-mo

00:36:41.553 --> 00:36:43.555
you're my child.

00:37:13.418 --> 00:37:14.419
Grandma.

00:37:14.961 --> 00:37:15.962
Yes?

00:37:17.422 --> 00:37:18.798
It's 1-2-2-5.

00:37:19.507 --> 00:37:20.884
What do you mean?

00:37:22.260 --> 00:37:23.553
It's my door code.

00:37:24.971 --> 00:37:27.474
You can come in anytime next time.

00:37:28.058 --> 00:37:30.101
Don't wait in the cold
like last night.

00:37:30.643 --> 00:37:31.853
It's 1-2-2-5.

00:37:32.479 --> 00:37:34.689
That's the day Jesus was born.

00:37:34.773 --> 00:37:36.316
He's Buddha's friend.

00:38:39.254 --> 00:38:41.297
How did you even get here?

00:38:41.965 --> 00:38:44.884
I tagged along on your business trip
as a little vacation.

00:38:44.968 --> 00:38:49.013
I missed you so much, In-gang.

00:38:51.641 --> 00:38:52.642
Hey.

00:38:53.017 --> 00:38:55.311
You looked great out there today.

00:38:55.395 --> 00:38:57.981
You literally killed it.

00:38:58.565 --> 00:38:59.858
I know you better than that.

00:39:04.904 --> 00:39:06.698
Why are you really here?

00:39:10.702 --> 00:39:13.496
It's about Director Yong's new work.

00:39:14.706 --> 00:39:16.958
We need to get back to him
by the end of the week.

00:39:17.041 --> 00:39:19.085
When are you going
to give me an answer?

00:39:19.169 --> 00:39:20.712
I knew you didn't just drop by.

00:39:21.254 --> 00:39:22.422
What's the holdup?

00:39:23.173 --> 00:39:25.175
You said you liked the script.

00:39:27.427 --> 00:39:28.428
Mi-ri.

00:39:28.511 --> 00:39:29.554
Yes?

00:39:31.181 --> 00:39:33.558
I'm thinking of doing something else.

00:39:33.641 --> 00:39:36.186
Something other
than dramas and movies?

00:39:36.269 --> 00:39:38.521
Do you want to be on variety shows?

00:39:38.605 --> 00:39:39.814
No, it's not that.

00:39:40.398 --> 00:39:41.399
Then what?

00:39:43.568 --> 00:39:45.445
Do you think I'm allowed to be happy?

00:39:47.405 --> 00:39:48.740
Oh, my goodness.

00:39:49.491 --> 00:39:51.534
What are you talking about?

00:39:53.119 --> 00:39:55.330
Lately,
I keep finding myself thinking

00:39:57.207 --> 00:39:58.958
"I'm happy.

00:40:00.710 --> 00:40:02.462
This is what happiness feels like."

00:40:02.879 --> 00:40:06.174
Hold on to that feeling
and stay happy at work.

00:40:06.674 --> 00:40:08.635
When I'm with Ah-jin

00:40:10.011 --> 00:40:11.387
it feels like a dream.

00:40:13.181 --> 00:40:14.974
I catch myself smiling for no reason.

00:40:16.142 --> 00:40:17.560
People say I've gone mad.

00:40:19.103 --> 00:40:20.396
But I'm happy.

00:40:21.314 --> 00:40:24.692
I'm so happy that it scares me.

00:40:25.735 --> 00:40:28.446
I'm scared that this will end.

00:40:29.155 --> 00:40:30.865
I'm afraid I'll be the one...

00:40:34.494 --> 00:40:36.204
who destroys this happiness.

00:40:45.380 --> 00:40:46.673
Don't tell me you're...

00:40:47.090 --> 00:40:49.842
No. Stop jumping to conclusions.

00:40:51.761 --> 00:40:54.931
I went to the department store
to buy Ah-jin a birthday gift

00:40:55.014 --> 00:40:56.849
and happened to see some baby shoes.

00:40:57.600 --> 00:40:58.810
They were so cute.

00:41:01.312 --> 00:41:02.730
I didn't even need them

00:41:03.606 --> 00:41:06.317
but I couldn't walk away
from these tiny shoes.

00:41:06.818 --> 00:41:07.902
So I bought them.

00:41:14.492 --> 00:41:17.036
Are you considering marrying Ah-jin?

00:41:21.791 --> 00:41:23.334
Does she want to marry you?

00:41:25.670 --> 00:41:26.671
I'm not sure.

00:41:29.465 --> 00:41:30.758
I hope she does.

00:41:34.178 --> 00:41:35.597
Look how small it is.

00:41:53.823 --> 00:41:54.824
Ah-jin.

00:42:16.471 --> 00:42:17.555
You seem surprised.

00:42:19.807 --> 00:42:22.352
No, I'm glad to see you.

00:42:27.273 --> 00:42:28.775
When did you get out?

00:42:29.108 --> 00:42:30.360
Not long ago.

00:42:31.736 --> 00:42:33.488
I was released sooner than expected.

00:42:38.951 --> 00:42:40.828
You look healthy.

00:42:47.418 --> 00:42:48.920
Are you at peace now?

00:42:50.672 --> 00:42:53.091
Yes, a little.

00:42:53.174 --> 00:42:54.967
And you got what you wanted?

00:43:00.556 --> 00:43:01.974
All thanks to you.

00:43:04.769 --> 00:43:06.270
And how do you think I am?

00:43:08.564 --> 00:43:10.191
You're a good person.

00:43:12.652 --> 00:43:14.862
I'm sure you can make it
through anything.

00:43:15.780 --> 00:43:16.906
"Good person"?

00:43:19.450 --> 00:43:21.744
How long do you think
I can stay that way?

00:43:26.749 --> 00:43:27.917
Look who it is!

00:43:28.793 --> 00:43:30.169
Jung-ho, is that you?

00:43:31.212 --> 00:43:32.422
What brings you here?

00:43:32.964 --> 00:43:37.009
You told me it was a beautiful temple
and said that I should stop by.

00:43:37.301 --> 00:43:38.302
How have you been?

00:43:38.678 --> 00:43:40.096
When did you get out?

00:43:40.179 --> 00:43:41.305
A couple of weeks ago.

00:43:42.223 --> 00:43:44.642
Goodness. You went through so much.

00:43:45.560 --> 00:43:47.562
This is my grandson.

00:43:48.604 --> 00:43:52.275
And she's
my older grandson's girlfriend.

00:43:52.358 --> 00:43:54.986
Ma'am, we've already met.

00:43:55.069 --> 00:43:56.904
You two know each other?

00:43:58.239 --> 00:43:59.240
Yes.

00:43:59.323 --> 00:44:02.410
I had to make ends meet
after graduating from high school

00:44:02.493 --> 00:44:04.203
and he helped me out a lot.

00:44:04.287 --> 00:44:05.288
I see.

00:44:05.997 --> 00:44:09.125
And I worked part-time
at his café for a year.

00:44:13.296 --> 00:44:16.215
How do you know Mrs. Hong?

00:44:17.216 --> 00:44:22.096
Well, we met at a temple...

00:44:22.180 --> 00:44:23.389
She came

00:44:24.974 --> 00:44:27.143
to volunteer at the prison I was in.

00:44:30.897 --> 00:44:33.441
Ma'am, I'll see you again soon.

00:44:34.108 --> 00:44:36.402
I've always wanted to buy you a meal.

00:44:36.486 --> 00:44:38.613
I'd love that.

00:44:38.696 --> 00:44:40.490
Hold on.

00:44:41.491 --> 00:44:43.284
- Give me your number.
- Sure.

00:44:47.246 --> 00:44:48.372
Here you go.

00:44:48.456 --> 00:44:50.958
I really hope we meet again.

00:44:51.709 --> 00:44:53.961
What a small world, you and Ah-jin.

00:45:19.362 --> 00:45:20.822
He still hasn't come home?

00:45:23.991 --> 00:45:24.992
You're home.

00:45:25.576 --> 00:45:26.911
What took you so long?

00:45:27.495 --> 00:45:28.996
I missed you like crazy.

00:45:39.465 --> 00:45:40.925
Who are you?

00:45:49.350 --> 00:45:50.393
Who are you?

00:45:50.476 --> 00:45:52.186
Why did you barge into
someone else's home?

00:45:52.270 --> 00:45:54.188
Exactly! What are you doing
in someone else's house?

00:45:55.398 --> 00:45:57.775
- What a pervert.
- "Pervert"?

00:45:58.150 --> 00:45:59.485
Why did you hug me?

00:45:59.569 --> 00:46:01.696
You hugged me from behind!

00:46:01.779 --> 00:46:02.905
Unbelievable.

00:46:10.079 --> 00:46:11.080
Seriously.

00:46:11.998 --> 00:46:15.543
You hide in a man's house
and hug him.

00:46:16.210 --> 00:46:18.921
Check his face first
if you're going to hug him.

00:46:20.006 --> 00:46:22.550
I don't let just anyone
touch my body.

00:46:25.553 --> 00:46:28.055
Did I steal a kiss
or take your pants off?

00:46:28.890 --> 00:46:31.183
All I did was hug you from behind.

00:46:31.267 --> 00:46:32.518
I'm the one who's offended.

00:46:32.977 --> 00:46:34.437
But I'm the victim.

00:46:37.732 --> 00:46:39.609
Jun-seo, that inconsiderate jerk.

00:46:40.109 --> 00:46:41.861
He should have warned me.

00:46:42.236 --> 00:46:44.155
Guess he doesn't
tell you much either.

00:46:47.575 --> 00:46:48.910
Let me ask you something.

00:46:49.827 --> 00:46:51.078
What are you two?

00:46:54.206 --> 00:46:56.334
You know what? Never mind.

00:46:56.417 --> 00:46:57.752
I don't even have to ask.

00:46:58.252 --> 00:47:00.671
You wait for him at home and hug him.

00:47:01.255 --> 00:47:02.465
That says it all.

00:47:03.466 --> 00:47:04.467
I'm out.

00:47:04.800 --> 00:47:06.010
What's your name?

00:47:08.721 --> 00:47:09.722
Why do you ask?

00:47:10.097 --> 00:47:15.061
We may be strangers,
but we did share a hug.

00:47:15.436 --> 00:47:18.356
- Excuse me?
- I've never met his friend before.

00:47:19.649 --> 00:47:23.486
I didn't know he had any friends,
so I figured I should get your name.

00:47:23.861 --> 00:47:25.196
Ask him yourself.

00:47:31.786 --> 00:47:33.788
Haven't we met before, though?

00:47:34.080 --> 00:47:36.457
Not "we". You must've seen me.

00:47:37.166 --> 00:47:38.167
On TV.

00:47:39.418 --> 00:47:40.419
TV?

00:47:44.340 --> 00:47:45.549
Right?

00:47:45.633 --> 00:47:46.759
The celebrity!

00:47:47.176 --> 00:47:49.261
The has-been--

00:47:56.769 --> 00:47:57.770
Sorry.

00:48:14.996 --> 00:48:16.205
Hey, boss!

00:48:17.331 --> 00:48:18.499
Is it really you?

00:48:19.250 --> 00:48:21.377
It's been a while, Jae-oh.

00:48:23.129 --> 00:48:24.255
Is something wrong?

00:48:25.047 --> 00:48:27.341
No. Not yet.

00:48:29.552 --> 00:48:31.554
What is it? You can tell me.

00:48:34.306 --> 00:48:35.307
Okay.

00:48:37.184 --> 00:48:38.185
All right.

00:48:39.186 --> 00:48:41.105
Send me his info
as soon as you get it.

00:48:42.231 --> 00:48:43.232
All right.

00:48:59.582 --> 00:49:00.750
Did Ah-jin call you?

00:49:02.293 --> 00:49:03.461
How did you know?

00:49:04.253 --> 00:49:07.089
You make a certain face
when you talk to her.

00:49:07.548 --> 00:49:08.591
What face?

00:49:10.968 --> 00:49:12.636
That's a face I want to punch.

00:49:12.720 --> 00:49:13.929
Imagine how I felt.

00:49:18.893 --> 00:49:20.770
If she's calling me

00:49:22.480 --> 00:49:24.190
that means something's up.

00:49:24.774 --> 00:49:26.233
Something doesn't feel right.

00:49:26.692 --> 00:49:28.069
How did she sound?

00:49:28.569 --> 00:49:30.988
More depressed than usual.

00:49:34.492 --> 00:49:35.701
Maybe I'm mistaken.

00:49:39.038 --> 00:49:40.498
What did she want?

00:49:42.708 --> 00:49:44.627
She told me not to tell you.

00:49:50.049 --> 00:49:52.885
Also, don't go home tonight.

00:49:53.177 --> 00:49:54.345
There's a crazy girl.

00:50:19.286 --> 00:50:23.749
There's good news shaking
both the literary and film worlds.

00:50:23.833 --> 00:50:25.918
A bestselling novel
that stirred major buzz

00:50:26.001 --> 00:50:28.379
is finally headed to the big screen.

00:50:28.462 --> 00:50:31.173
Author Yoon Seok-ha,
winner of the Ennoble Literary Award

00:50:31.257 --> 00:50:33.300
has announced that his latest work,
Winter Sleep

00:50:33.384 --> 00:50:35.177
is being adapted into a film.

00:50:35.261 --> 00:50:37.638
Winter Sleep is a novel
about a man and a woman

00:50:37.721 --> 00:50:39.723
who reunite after parting ways

00:50:39.807 --> 00:50:44.979
slowly healing their past wounds
and rebuilding their love together.

00:50:45.062 --> 00:50:48.732
Meanwhile, Yoon Seok-ha was spotted
on a date with actress Lena

00:50:48.816 --> 00:50:50.359
sparking romance rumors.

00:50:50.442 --> 00:50:53.112
With Lena's name being mentioned
as the heroine of Winter Sleep

00:50:53.195 --> 00:50:56.073
the online communities
are buzzing with speculation.

00:50:57.950 --> 00:50:59.660
CEO YOON JUN-SEO

00:51:13.716 --> 00:51:16.427
You're Mr. Yoon Jun-seo, right?

00:51:17.803 --> 00:51:19.096
Do you know me?

00:51:20.931 --> 00:51:24.602
We haven't met,
but I know enough about you.

00:51:31.442 --> 00:51:33.777
It's surprising enough that you,
the author of Winter Sleep

00:51:33.861 --> 00:51:37.323
had been an anonymous investor
in Longstar for the past year.

00:51:37.781 --> 00:51:41.202
But it turns out you were
Ah-jin's secret benefactor too.

00:51:43.204 --> 00:51:44.371
Is Ah-jin doing okay?

00:51:44.914 --> 00:51:46.749
So you haven't seen her lately?

00:51:46.832 --> 00:51:49.460
Are you curious
about her and In-gang?

00:51:49.710 --> 00:51:52.213
I just want her happy.

00:51:52.588 --> 00:51:57.676
She's confident and ambitious.
And she's loaded with talent.

00:51:57.760 --> 00:52:00.387
When she wants something,
she goes straight for it.

00:52:00.471 --> 00:52:03.349
And she can be mesmerizing
when needed.

00:52:03.432 --> 00:52:05.684
Is actor Heo In-gang okay?

00:52:07.603 --> 00:52:09.813
Thanks for asking about him too.

00:52:11.190 --> 00:52:15.819
I was worried myself,
but he's happier than ever.

00:52:19.031 --> 00:52:22.326
In-gang isn't just one of our actors.

00:52:22.409 --> 00:52:24.620
He's like a brother
I deeply care about.

00:52:25.079 --> 00:52:28.874
I would never let anything
make him unhappy.

00:52:29.458 --> 00:52:31.919
I would never let anything
make Ah-jin unhappy, either.

00:52:32.002 --> 00:52:34.296
You also need to honor
the contract terms.

00:52:35.047 --> 00:52:36.048
We will.

00:52:38.259 --> 00:52:40.469
Ah-jin's burnt out,
even if she won't say it.

00:52:40.552 --> 00:52:41.971
She needs rest.

00:52:42.346 --> 00:52:44.181
She's in her mid-20s.

00:52:44.265 --> 00:52:46.475
She should be working, not resting.

00:52:47.142 --> 00:52:49.103
It's not about age.

00:52:49.520 --> 00:52:51.814
Don't tell me you're
seriously considering marrying her.

00:52:53.190 --> 00:52:55.818
She has a big future ahead of her.

00:52:56.318 --> 00:52:58.320
Don't think about tying her down.

00:52:58.946 --> 00:53:01.615
Why does it have to be her
for that show?

00:53:02.324 --> 00:53:04.368
That was the author's condition.

00:53:04.451 --> 00:53:06.954
Studios are desperate
to adapt Winter Sleep

00:53:07.037 --> 00:53:09.373
so the competition was fierce.

00:53:09.832 --> 00:53:13.585
What let our company win the bid
was exactly that condition.

00:53:16.005 --> 00:53:17.840
This is hard, In-gang.

00:53:18.882 --> 00:53:19.883
Let's talk later.

00:53:31.562 --> 00:53:32.646
Author Yoon Seok-ha?

00:53:33.689 --> 00:53:34.690
What about him?

00:53:35.274 --> 00:53:36.275
You didn't see the news?

00:53:37.234 --> 00:53:38.777
They say he's dating Lena.

00:53:38.861 --> 00:53:40.654
Really? Good for them.

00:53:43.324 --> 00:53:48.370
He's insisting that you star
in the drama adaptation of his work.

00:53:50.456 --> 00:53:52.458
That was his condition
for investing in our company.

00:53:54.376 --> 00:53:55.377
I heard.

00:53:57.463 --> 00:53:58.464
You knew?

00:53:58.797 --> 00:54:00.507
The script was decent.

00:54:01.091 --> 00:54:03.218
So I told him
I'd discuss it with you.

00:54:03.969 --> 00:54:06.972
It seems that Ms. Seo
really wants me to do it.

00:54:07.765 --> 00:54:08.974
What do you think?

00:54:11.018 --> 00:54:14.563
Let's think it over for one week.

00:54:15.230 --> 00:54:16.231
Okay.

00:54:45.469 --> 00:54:46.470
You're late.

00:54:50.182 --> 00:54:51.225
You're the one who's late.

00:54:52.142 --> 00:54:53.811
It's been over a year.

00:54:54.311 --> 00:54:57.648
You promised you'd come back.

00:55:00.943 --> 00:55:02.986
Congratulations, you pulled it off.

00:55:05.823 --> 00:55:09.034
You blackmailed Ms. Seo with money,
poked at In-gang

00:55:09.118 --> 00:55:10.744
and made me come to you.

00:55:12.913 --> 00:55:13.914
I'm impressed.

00:55:14.373 --> 00:55:16.500
You're the one making me this way.

00:55:19.378 --> 00:55:20.754
Ms. Seo told me.

00:55:23.006 --> 00:55:24.049
Why?

00:55:25.801 --> 00:55:26.969
I wanted to help you.

00:55:28.345 --> 00:55:30.139
That's my duty, isn't it?

00:55:32.266 --> 00:55:33.267
It always has been.

00:55:33.350 --> 00:55:36.311
- What do you want me to do?
- That's my question.

00:55:37.688 --> 00:55:40.023
Isn't it time to end it with In-gang?

00:55:41.066 --> 00:55:42.067
Why?

00:55:43.861 --> 00:55:45.571
Did you actually
fall in love with him?

00:55:54.997 --> 00:55:55.998
What about you?

00:55:57.207 --> 00:56:00.127
I heard you were dating Lena.

00:56:00.544 --> 00:56:01.545
Yes.

00:56:02.421 --> 00:56:03.422
Why?

00:56:04.214 --> 00:56:06.633
- Does it bother you?
- She used to torment me.

00:56:07.384 --> 00:56:09.052
You don't know what she'll pull.

00:56:09.136 --> 00:56:11.096
All the more reason
to keep her close.

00:56:11.180 --> 00:56:13.765
So I can stop her
from getting to you.

00:56:19.605 --> 00:56:21.064
Something's different

00:56:22.357 --> 00:56:23.358
about you.

00:56:24.610 --> 00:56:25.694
People...

00:56:30.407 --> 00:56:31.492
change.

00:56:46.632 --> 00:56:47.758
You didn't eat, right?

00:56:54.014 --> 00:56:55.224
Hi, Lena.

00:56:57.267 --> 00:56:58.352
Why are you here?

00:57:00.395 --> 00:57:01.563
Explain.

00:57:01.647 --> 00:57:03.982
- We were talking.
- "Talking"?

00:57:04.066 --> 00:57:06.652
Then, do it outside, not here.

00:57:07.194 --> 00:57:10.697
Does In-gang know you're here?

00:57:11.573 --> 00:57:12.574
Actually...

00:57:13.075 --> 00:57:16.119
Can you two
even make your relationship public?

00:57:19.248 --> 00:57:20.332
Do as you please.

00:57:20.958 --> 00:57:21.959
Hey.

00:57:22.042 --> 00:57:24.044
You think I won't?

00:57:24.127 --> 00:57:26.421
Let go! This is so wrong!

00:57:31.927 --> 00:57:33.345
I tailed him for a few days.

00:57:33.428 --> 00:57:36.139
He went to pay respects to your dad.
He cried and apologized.

00:57:36.890 --> 00:57:38.100
He still hasn't changed.

00:57:38.767 --> 00:57:39.768
Is that all?

00:57:39.851 --> 00:57:42.688
He usually does volunteer work
in the afternoon and goes home.

00:57:43.105 --> 00:57:45.148
He doesn't drink or meet his friends.

00:57:45.232 --> 00:57:47.776
When there's no volunteer work,
he goes to the gym

00:57:48.360 --> 00:57:49.778
or reads at a café.

00:57:50.821 --> 00:57:52.155
I don't think you need to worry.

00:57:53.365 --> 00:57:54.366
Okay.

00:58:00.247 --> 00:58:01.331
Is dating fun?

00:58:02.708 --> 00:58:03.709
Why do you ask?

00:58:06.169 --> 00:58:07.170
Because it looks like it.

00:58:07.963 --> 00:58:09.172
You don't call me

00:58:10.966 --> 00:58:12.134
because you're doing well.

00:58:13.468 --> 00:58:16.305
Yes, I'm doing well. I'm happy.

00:58:28.483 --> 00:58:30.068
Did you look into
that exposé about Ah-jin?

00:58:30.360 --> 00:58:31.361
How did it go?

00:58:31.445 --> 00:58:34.072
It was deleted
an hour after it was posted.

00:58:34.156 --> 00:58:35.782
And the source is unverified.

00:58:36.116 --> 00:58:37.576
"Can't and won't."

00:58:38.744 --> 00:58:40.746
You think I pay you to hear that?

00:58:41.121 --> 00:58:43.457
When did I ever say
that I can't or won't?

00:58:44.333 --> 00:58:46.418
Give me some time. I'm still digging.

00:58:48.587 --> 00:58:49.588
Dong-gyu, it's me.

00:58:50.297 --> 00:58:51.298
Lena.

00:58:52.049 --> 00:58:55.010
Do you know
where In-gang is right now?

00:59:03.018 --> 00:59:04.019
Where are we going?

00:59:05.228 --> 00:59:07.731
You'll see. It'll be fun.

00:59:25.374 --> 00:59:26.875
Happy birthday, Ah-jin.

00:59:27.417 --> 00:59:28.418
Thanks.

00:59:45.477 --> 00:59:48.271
This might be cringe

00:59:49.272 --> 00:59:50.941
so please don't laugh.

00:59:52.067 --> 00:59:53.151
What's it about?

00:59:54.277 --> 00:59:55.278
Go on.

01:00:01.284 --> 01:00:02.828
I'm so grateful

01:00:04.413 --> 01:00:05.664
you were born

01:00:06.748 --> 01:00:08.667
and that you came into my life.

01:00:12.462 --> 01:00:15.799
It's been a year,
and when I'm with you

01:00:17.634 --> 01:00:18.719
my heart still races.

01:00:19.886 --> 01:00:25.559
This might be sudden,
but I hope you won't say no.

01:00:29.855 --> 01:00:32.691
They must have told me
the wrong floor.

01:00:36.987 --> 01:00:37.988
In-gang.

01:00:39.239 --> 01:00:41.950
What are you doing here with Ah-jin?

01:00:45.495 --> 01:00:47.414
- Can't you tell?
- A date?

01:00:47.497 --> 01:00:48.999
Oh, it's your birthday.

01:00:50.709 --> 01:00:52.294
Happy birthday.

01:00:54.713 --> 01:00:56.631
I'm also here on a date.

01:00:57.215 --> 01:00:59.634
Since we're all here,
why don't we celebrate together?

01:01:01.011 --> 01:01:02.721
Is that okay, Jun-seo?

01:01:07.309 --> 01:01:08.769
Mind if I sit?

01:01:09.603 --> 01:01:10.812
Take a seat, Jun-seo.

01:01:28.330 --> 01:01:32.959
That's right. I heard you two
used to be classmates.

01:01:34.127 --> 01:01:35.879
We live in such a small world.

01:01:36.922 --> 01:01:38.215
What a coincidence.

01:01:40.717 --> 01:01:41.718
Classmates?

01:01:43.637 --> 01:01:45.013
Technically

01:01:46.097 --> 01:01:47.390
we were siblings.

01:01:47.474 --> 01:01:50.393
Our parents remarried
when we were young.

01:01:54.815 --> 01:01:57.484
It's not exactly my favorite memory.

01:01:58.860 --> 01:01:59.861
Yeah?

01:02:00.445 --> 01:02:01.446
Why?

01:02:02.614 --> 01:02:07.661
My mother didn't treat her
so well back then.

01:02:09.162 --> 01:02:10.747
Because of that

01:02:11.915 --> 01:02:14.709
I still feel guilty

01:02:15.085 --> 01:02:18.129
and am willing to do
anything for her.

01:02:19.005 --> 01:02:20.173
You don't have to.

01:02:20.924 --> 01:02:22.259
I've gotten over it.

01:02:25.720 --> 01:02:26.721
I'm fine.

01:02:28.223 --> 01:02:29.224
You're right.

01:02:31.560 --> 01:02:33.562
You look fine. I'm happy for you.

01:02:35.689 --> 01:02:36.773
Happy birthday.

01:02:44.781 --> 01:02:46.867
I should congratulate
you two as well.

01:02:46.950 --> 01:02:48.368
We're just friends.

01:02:52.414 --> 01:02:53.415
He's right.

01:02:55.625 --> 01:02:57.168
We're only using each other.

01:03:00.463 --> 01:03:04.342
By the way, why did you come
to Jun-seo's place the other night?

01:03:04.926 --> 01:03:06.386
It was so late at night.

01:03:06.970 --> 01:03:08.513
You really scared me.

01:03:09.222 --> 01:03:10.307
That was

01:03:11.933 --> 01:03:13.226
because

01:03:14.185 --> 01:03:18.064
I wanted to politely turn down
Winter Sleep.

01:03:21.651 --> 01:03:22.652
What's wrong?

01:03:23.820 --> 01:03:26.364
How do you tell such a blatant lie
with a smile on your face?

01:03:27.324 --> 01:03:30.619
That was not the vibe
I picked up from them.

01:03:33.330 --> 01:03:34.831
It's her birthday.

01:03:35.874 --> 01:03:38.251
Take it down a notch.
We're here to celebrate.

01:03:42.881 --> 01:03:44.215
You'll have to excuse us.

01:04:00.941 --> 01:04:03.193
I want you to be straight with me.

01:04:04.319 --> 01:04:05.487
Is it me or Ah-jin?

01:04:06.404 --> 01:04:07.948
Do you even want to help me?

01:04:08.531 --> 01:04:09.950
Whatever you do

01:04:11.034 --> 01:04:13.411
- In-gang won't go back to you.
- I know that.

01:04:13.495 --> 01:04:15.080
You think I'm doing this
to win him back?

01:04:15.622 --> 01:04:19.167
Why her, though,
out of all the women?

01:04:20.168 --> 01:04:21.544
There's something wrong with her.

01:04:22.128 --> 01:04:24.214
Didn't you see how brazen she was

01:04:24.297 --> 01:04:26.549
when her relationship
with you was exposed?

01:04:26.883 --> 01:04:29.803
She's a really bad person.

01:04:29.886 --> 01:04:31.554
Do you really not see it?

01:04:31.638 --> 01:04:34.808
Why does no one see it but me?

01:04:59.499 --> 01:05:01.001
Oh, dear.

01:05:35.035 --> 01:05:37.871
Are you two really siblings?

01:05:39.039 --> 01:05:40.040
Yes.

01:05:40.790 --> 01:05:41.791
We were.

01:05:42.625 --> 01:05:43.877
Why didn't you tell me?

01:05:47.964 --> 01:05:50.759
I didn't tell you
because you never asked.

01:05:51.843 --> 01:05:53.678
You can ask me anything.

01:05:54.220 --> 01:05:55.346
I'll answer.

01:06:01.269 --> 01:06:02.520
Just siblings?

01:06:03.480 --> 01:06:04.647
Not anymore.

01:06:06.232 --> 01:06:08.401
Our parents got divorced.

01:06:09.986 --> 01:06:10.987
I'm sorry.

01:06:13.448 --> 01:06:14.699
For what?

01:06:16.868 --> 01:06:17.869
One second.

01:06:20.371 --> 01:06:21.956
Hey, In-mo. What's up?

01:06:26.127 --> 01:06:27.128
What?

01:06:28.421 --> 01:06:29.506
She found it?

01:06:31.174 --> 01:06:32.175
What is it?

01:06:32.634 --> 01:06:34.844
My grandma found the notebook
she lost last year.

01:06:37.430 --> 01:06:38.515
She did?

01:06:39.557 --> 01:06:40.558
Okay.

01:06:41.392 --> 01:06:42.393
All right.

01:06:45.605 --> 01:06:47.190
The notebook?

01:06:47.857 --> 01:06:51.778
She used to write in it like a diary,
but she lost it last year.

01:06:52.362 --> 01:06:53.363
She found that.

01:06:54.906 --> 01:06:57.617
She went to your place
to cook a birthday meal for you

01:06:57.700 --> 01:07:00.912
but now she's lying down
and hasn't eaten anything.

01:07:01.579 --> 01:07:05.542
In-mo's out of town, so she's alone.
And I have to catch a flight tonight.

01:07:09.462 --> 01:07:10.463
Ah-jin.

01:07:11.673 --> 01:07:13.133
Can you check on her for me?

01:07:22.934 --> 01:07:25.103
It feels like we crashed
your birthday party.

01:07:27.438 --> 01:07:28.439
Ah-jin.

01:07:30.191 --> 01:07:31.526
Happy birthday.

01:07:32.610 --> 01:07:35.155
We'll head out. Have a great time.

01:08:07.353 --> 01:08:08.688
It's 1-2-2-5.

01:08:09.522 --> 01:08:11.858
You can come in anytime next time.

01:08:57.946 --> 01:08:59.030
Wait out here.

01:10:03.636 --> 01:10:04.637
You're here.

01:10:27.160 --> 01:10:28.161
How did it go?

01:10:28.911 --> 01:10:29.912
Nothing yet.

01:10:46.721 --> 01:10:47.722
Ah-jin.

01:12:10.012 --> 01:12:14.434
DEAR X

01:14:33.948 --> 01:14:35.950
Subtitles by Ho-young Yun